{
  "_comment": "Shared test fixture for the copied money calculations: rule_engine/src/lite/money.ts (waveAmounts, accountDrift) and mcp_server/src/lib/waveDeployment.ts + portfolio.ts (computeWaveDeployment, computePortfolioDrift). Each package's test checks it. Illustrative numbers only.",
